[h2]Build 0.9.138[/h2]
[h3]Fixed[/h3]
[list]
[*]When gear has no materials of its own and more than one recipe makes it, the mod now tries each recipe in turn until one gives real materials, instead of trusting only the first - another fix for quivers and similar accessories being refused as "cannot be recycled". With dev mode on, anything that still ends up "made of nothing" is logged with the recipes that were considered.
[/list]
